#: src/components/guide/tours.tsx
msgid "<0>我的模板</0>装的是你自己做的，新做一个也从那里进：传一段视频，让 AI 把画面里的人换成一模一样的白色人偶，或者直接拿你本来就做好的白模片用。走哪条路在提取器<1>打开后的第一屏</1>挑；要花多少钱到框选那一步当场整句报出来，确认了才开炼。"
msgstr "<0>My templates</0> holds the ones you made yourself, and it's also where you start a new one: upload a video and let the AI replace the people in it with identical white mannequins, or use a blockout clip you've already made. You choose the route on <1>the first screen after the extractor opens</1>; the cost is spelled out in full right at the selection step, and nothing starts until you confirm."

#: src/pages/SupportModelNewPage.tsx
msgid "<0>我确认：</0><1/>· 这个模型是我做的，或者我已经拿到作者授权；<2/>· 我没有上传他人作品、真人肖像，也没有上传 Live2D 官方示例模型；<3/>· 违规的内容会被下架，情节严重的可能会封号。"
msgstr "<0>I confirm:</0><1/>· I made this model, or I have the creator's permission;<2/>· I'm not uploading someone else's work, a real person's likeness, or an official Live2D sample model;<3/>· I understand that violating content will be taken down, and serious cases may lead to account suspension."

#: src/components/blockout/BoxFramePicker.tsx
msgid "<0>标在场景切换、人数变化的那一帧</0>：每段是独立模板、各认一次人， 切在镜头边界上每段都认得更准。<1>不标也行</1>——会自动对半切到每段 ≤30 秒；标了之后还超 30 秒的段也会自动补刀。切出来不足 4 秒的刀落不下去，会整句告诉你。"
msgstr "<0>Mark the frame where the scene or the number of people changes</0>: each segment is its own template and detects people on its own, so cutting on shot boundaries makes every segment more accurate. <1>Marking is optional</1> — it halves automatically until every segment is ≤30s, and any segment still over 30s after your cuts gets extra cuts automatically. A cut that would leave less than 4s can't be placed, and you'll be told why."

#: src/components/guide/tours.tsx
msgid "<0>点标题进详情页</0>——本片卡组、多 P 选集、完整简介、「互动 · 你来选」的分支，都<1>只在那儿</1>。点作者名或头像，去的是他的主页。"
msgstr "<0>Tap the title to open the details page</0> — the cards from this video, multi-part episodes, the full description and the “Interactive · you choose” branches are <1>only there</1>. Tapping the author's name or avatar takes you to their profile."

#: src/components/blockout/VisionFramePicker.tsx
msgid "<0>画面里人数会变（有人入场 / 离场）时用这个</0>：在变化的<1>前后各标一帧</1>，AI 才认得全。其余情况用「自动」就够了。"
msgstr "<0>Use this when the number of people changes (someone enters / leaves)</0>: mark <1>one frame before and one after</1> each change so the AI catches everyone. Otherwise “Auto” is enough."

#: src/components/blockout/BoxFramePicker.tsx
msgid "<0>素材有分镜切换、或者人会进出画面时用这个</0>：拖到一帧<1>人最齐、最能代表这一段</1>的画面，标下来。标了几帧就按你标的顺序依次试。"
msgstr "<0>Use this when the footage cuts between shots or people come and go</0>: drag to a frame <1>where everyone is present and that best represents the clip</1>, and mark it. Marked frames are tried in the order you marked them."

#: src/components/blockout/VisionFramePicker.tsx
msgid "<0>这一步不是每次都全对。</0>实测每隔几发就会有 1~2 个人<1>根本没被换成人偶</1>（还是原来的样子） —— 最常出错的是<2>画面正中央、看起来最像主角的那一个</2>。 出片之后你要对着画面从左往右数一遍：对不上的位子删掉就行（不用重炼、不花钱）， 要全对上只能重炼（<3>重炼要再花一次钱</3>）。<4>画面里的人越少越准</4>，也可以在下面多标几帧让 AI 少看漏人。"
msgstr "<0>This step isn't always fully right.</0> In testing, every few runs 1–2 people <1>weren't turned into mannequins at all</1> (they still look the same) — most often <2>the one in the middle of the frame who looks most like the lead</2>. Once the video is made, count across the picture from left to right: just delete any slot that doesn't match (no re-render, no charge); getting every slot right means re-rendering (<3>re-rendering costs again</3>). <4>The fewer people in the picture, the more accurate it is</4>, and you can mark more frames below so the AI misses fewer people."

