msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 什么都没返回——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI returned nothing — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改写时动了「{pair}」这条绑定（位置与角色名必须原样成对，配错了就是把卡换到别人身上）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI altered the binding “{pair}” while rewriting (the position and character name must stay paired exactly; a mismatch puts the card on someone else) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改写时动了「{pair}」这条绑定（编号与角色名必须原样成对，配错了就是把卡换到别人身上）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI altered the binding “{pair}” while rewriting (the number and character name must stay paired exactly; a mismatch puts the card on someone else) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改写时把「{slotText}」这个角色位弄丢了（位置换个说法就会把卡换到别人身上）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI dropped the role slot “{slotText}” while rewriting (describing the position differently puts the card on someone else) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改写时把「{slotText}」这个角色位弄丢了（编号错一位就会把卡换到别人身上）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI dropped the role slot “{slotText}” while rewriting (a number off by one puts the card on someone else) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改写时把「去掉人偶身上的编号」这句丢了（丢了的话成片里人物头上会顶着编号，钱花完才看得出来）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI dropped the “remove the numbers from the mannequins” line while rewriting (without it, the people in the video wear numbers on their heads, which you'd only see after paying) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改写时把角色位的先后顺序打乱了（这段话必须按画面上从左到右的顺序写，顺序一乱就会换错人——实测同样三张卡，只把顺序写反，5 个位子里就错了 3 个）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI shuffled the order of the role slots while rewriting (this text must follow the left-to-right order on screen, and out of order means the wrong people get swapped — in testing, with the same three cards and only the order reversed, 3 of 5 slots were wrong) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败：AI 改动了「{sentence}」这句成组绑定（个数、顺序、名字任何一个变了，这 {count} 个位子就会整片换错人）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt: the AI changed the group binding “{sentence}” (if the count, the order or any name changes, all {count} slots get the wrong people) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

#: src/studio/blockoutPrompt.ts
msgid "提示词合成失败（{why}）——这一段的要求请自己写，或用下面那份默认写法。"
msgstr "Couldn't compose the prompt ({why}) — write this segment's request yourself, or use the default version below."

