#: src/hooks/useFlowActions.ts
msgid "点「完成视频」还会提炼本片卡组：你挂过的卡直接入组，缺的卡种 AI 补齐（风格卡必有；背景卡是你写的故事背景，不自动出），最多 {maxCards} 张、约 {cardsTok} token；这条片写了 3D / 建模一类的画风，还会给派生的角色卡铸最多 {max3d} 个 3D 建模，另约 {model3dTok} token。都按实际出卡结算，余额不够会自动跳过（成片不受影响）。"
msgstr "Tapping “Finish video” also extracts this video's deck: cards you've added go straight in, and AI fills in the missing card types (a style card is always included; the background card is the story background you wrote and isn't generated), up to {maxCards} cards for about {cardsTok} tokens; this video uses a 3D / modeling style, so it will also mint up to {max3d} 3D models for the derived character cards, for about {model3dTok} more tokens. Everything is billed by what's actually produced, and if your balance runs short those steps are skipped (the video itself isn't affected)."

#: src/hooks/useFlowActions.ts
msgid "点「完成视频」还会提炼本片卡组：你挂过的卡直接入组，缺的卡种 AI 补齐（风格卡必有；背景卡是你写的故事背景，不自动出），最多 {maxCards} 张、约 {cardsTok} token。都按实际出卡结算，余额不够会自动跳过（成片不受影响）。"
msgstr "Tapping “Finish video” also extracts this video's deck: cards you've added go straight in, and AI fills in the missing card types (a style card is always included; the background card is the story background you wrote and isn't generated), up to {maxCards} cards for about {cardsTok} tokens. Everything is billed by what's actually produced, and if your balance runs short that step is skipped (the video itself isn't affected)."

