#: src/components/guide/tours.tsx
msgid "点<0>用它出片</0>就跳到出片那一屏，接下来怎么走按模板分两种：<1>带角色位</1>的那种，本段内容区是一颗挂卡的钮——点开把你的角色卡逐个挂到人偶身上，还能另加一句自己的要求；其余的（经典配方、没有角色位的老白模）是写一句话，配方会把它填进每一段剧情。每段要花多少写在「生成本段」那颗按钮上，点它之前不花钱。"
msgstr "Tap <0>Use this template</0> to jump to the rendering screen. What comes next depends on the template: for ones <1>with role slots</1>, this segment's content area is a cast-cards button — open it to attach your character cards to the mannequins one by one, and you can add a request of your own; for the rest (classic recipes and older blockouts without role slots) you write one sentence, and the recipe fills it into every segment's story. Each segment's cost is shown on the “Generate this segment” button, and nothing is spent until you tap it."

