#: src/components/guide/tours.tsx
msgid "角标写着这个模板能干什么。<0>白模</0>：出片时整段复刻它的场景、道具与运镜，只把人换掉，旁边报的是这条模板视频有多长——成片长度和画幅都跟着它走；<1>几个角色位可换人</1>：画面里那几个白色人偶，各能挂一张你的角色卡。没角标的是经典配方模板，按分镜骨架重新画，旁边报的是分几段。"
msgstr "The badges say what a template can do. <0>Blockout</0>: rendering copies its whole scene, props and camera work and only swaps the people, and the number shown with it is how long the template video is — the finished video's length and aspect ratio follow it. <1>Recastable slots</1>: each of the white mannequins in the picture can take one of your character cards. Templates without a badge are classic recipe templates, redrawn from the shot outline, and the number shown is how many segments they have."

